BER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106724","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106724.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106724.patch","merged_at":"2025-05-26T16:30:23Z"},"body":"- Regenerate the `GodotAppMainTheme` and `GodotAppSplashTheme` during Android export. Any manual changes to this style will be cleared and replaced with default theme attributes.\r\n\r\n- Adds a new export option `gradle_build/custom_theme_attributes` for injecting custom theme attributes directly via the export window, avoiding the need to manually modify themes.xml.\r\n\r\nIt helps to avoid the issue I metioned in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106709#discussion_r2103088921.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9326e82d-3843-4a15-ab4e-5bc29a212f5f)\r\nAccording to the attributes shown in the image:\r\n- The first pair adds `<item name=\"android:windowIsTranslucent\">true</item>` to the GodotAppMainTheme.\r\n- In the second pair key is prefixed with `[splash]`, so it adds the attribute to the GodotAppSplashTheme.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","even